  "title": "Vietnamese Beef Pho",
  "description": "Make lemongrass pho with rice noodles and paper-thin slices of top round or sirloin, then garnish it with veggies, herbs, and your choice of sauces.",
  "authors": [
    "Maryellen"
  ],
